      "value": "@{5d60e4d6698f8c20c0f5a295|full_name}: or simply make it a setting the individual has to manually turn on for a given avatar they wish to see interactions with such dynamic bones. It would be a setting for that player to see dynamic bones interacting with other player models for THAT specific avatar. What I had in mind was for say a player B has an avatar that allows dynamic bones interactions and tells me player A about it or something. Then player C with interactive dynamic bones colliders messed with those bones I can still see player B's bones being messed with. Or okay just make it a global setting. Still give the players themselves the ability to toggle it on.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
